      "retrieved_at": "2026-10-26T15:57:20.328421+00:00",
      "support_text": "REDMOND, Wash. — July 29, 2026 — Microsoft Corp. today announced the following results for the quarter ended June 30, 2026, as compared to the corresponding period of last fiscal year:",
      "eligible_for_prose": true
    },
    "E5:B6": {
      "url": "https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/789019/000119312526323632/msft-ex99_1.htm",
      "locator": "HTML text block 6",
      "sha256": "5d7e2f77e7af504e18c2fcbcb981c34442a9570bc0d49cb06ac40f110e285052",
      "kind": "disclosure excerpt",
      "document_id": "E5",
      "document_kind": "earnings/event exhibit",
      "source_report_date": "2026-07-29",
      "publication_date": "2026-07-29",
      "period_basis": "duration not established from this excerpt",
      "retrieved_at": "2026-10-26T15:57:20.328421+00:00",
      "selection_topic": "results",
      "context_citation_ids": [
        "E5:B4"
      ],
      "support_text": "Revenue was $90.0 billion and increased 18% (up 17% in constant currency)",
      "eligible_for_prose": true
    },
    "E5:B72": {
      "url": "https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/789019/000119312526323632/msft-ex99_1.htm",
      "locator": "HTML text block 72",
      "sha256": "5d7e2f77e7af504e18c2fcbcb981c34442a9570bc0d49cb06ac40f110e285052",
      "kind": "disclosure excerpt",
      "document_id": "E5",
      "document_kind": "earnings/event exhibit",
      "source_report_date": "2026-07-29",
      "publication_date": "2026-07-29",
      "period_basis": "duration not established from this excerpt",
      "retrieved_at": "2026-10-26T15:57:20.328421+00:00",
      "selection_topic": "drivers",
      "context_citation_ids": [
        "E5:B4"
      ],
      "support_text": "Revenue in Intelligent Cloud was $39.3 billion and increased 32% (up 31% in constant currency), with the following business highlights:",
      "eligible_for_prose": true
    },
    "E5:B15": {
      "url": "https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/789019/000119312526323632/msft-ex99_1.htm",
      "locator": "HTML text block 15",
      "sha256": "5d7e2f77e7af504e18c2fcbcb981c34442a9570bc0d49cb06ac40f110e285052",
      "kind": "disclosure excerpt",
      "document_id": "E5",
      "document_kind": "earnings/event exhibit",
      "source_report_date": "2026-07-29",
      "publication_date": "2026-07-29",
      "period_basis": "quarterly (three months)",
      "retrieved_at": "2026-10-26T15:57:20.328421+00:00",
      "selection_topic": "explanation",
      "context_citation_ids": [
        "E5:B4"
      ],
      "support_text": "Several discrete items impacted our financial results in the quarter when compared to our forward-looking guidance provided on April 29, 2026, resulting in a benefit of $0.27 on diluted earnings per share. These include a $3.2 billion gain from our investment in Anthropic and lower-than-expected expenses related to the Voluntary Retirement Program which were partially offset by severance expense and impairment charges in XBOX. When adjusting for these items, we exceeded expectations across revenue, operating income, and diluted earnings per share.",
      "eligible_for_prose": true
    },
    "E5:B17": {
      "url": "https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/789019/000119312526323632/msft-ex99_1.htm",
      "locator": "HTML text block 17",
      "sha256": "5d7e2f77e7af504e18c2fcbcb981c34442a9570bc0d49cb06ac40f110e285052",
      "kind": "disclosure excerpt",
      "document_id": "E5",
      "document_kind": "earnings/event exhibit",
      "source_report_date": "2026-07-29",
      "publication_date": "2026-07-29",
      "period_basis": "quarterly (three months)",
      "retrieved_at": "2026-10-26T15:57:20.328421+00:00",
      "selection_topic": "drivers",
      "context_citation_ids": [
        "E5:B4"
      ],
      "support_text": "“We delivered a strong quarter to close out the fiscal year, highlighted by Microsoft Cloud revenue of $59.3 billion, up 27% year-over-year,” said Amy Hood, executive vice president and chief financial officer of Microsoft.",
      "eligible_for_prose": true
    },
    "E5:B82": {
      "url": "https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/789019/000119312526323632/msft-ex99_1.htm",
      "locator": "HTML text block 82",
      "sha256": "5d7e2f77e7af504e18c2fcbcb981c34442a9570bc0d49cb06ac40f110e285052",
      "kind": "disclosure excerpt",
      "document_id": "E5",
      "document_kind": "earnings/event exhibit",
      "source_report_date": "2026-07-29",
      "publication_date": "2026-07-29",
      "period_basis": "quarterly (three months)",
      "retrieved_at": "2026-10-26T15:57:20.328421+00:00",
      "selection_topic": "capital",
      "context_citation_ids": [
        "E5:B4"
      ],
      "support_text": "Microsoft returned $10.2 billion to shareholders in the form of dividends and share repurchases in the fourth quarter of fiscal year 2026.",
      "eligible_for_prose": true
    },
    "E5:B10": {
      "url": "https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/789019/000119312526323632/msft-ex99_1.htm",
      "locator": "HTML text block 10",
      "sha256": "5d7e2f77e7af504e18c2fcbcb981c34442a9570bc0d49cb06ac40f110e285052",
      "kind": "disclosure excerpt",
      "document_id": "E5",
      "document_kind": "earnings/event exhibit",
      "source_report_date": "2026-07-29",
      "publication_date": "2026-07-29",
      "period_basis": "duration not established from this excerpt",
      "retrieved_at": "2026-10-26T15:57:20.328421+00:00",
      "selection_topic": "results",
      "context_citation_ids": [
        "E5:B4"
      ],
      "support_text": "Net income was $35.8 billion and increased 31% on a GAAP basis, and was $35.3 billion and increased 22% on a non-GAAP basis",
      "eligible_for_prose": true
    }
